  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - DG INTPA Effective dev policy Team Europ&#xe9;, Bryssel - National Expert - DG INTPA Effective dev policy TE, Bryssel, New strategy EK</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - DG INTPA Effective dev policy Team Europe, Bryssel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser sekundering av en nationell expert som Effective Development Policy Officer for Team Europe till DG INTPA.D1. Enhet INTPA.D.1 &#xe4;r centrum f&#xf6;r Team Europe-strategin och samordnar de olika arbetsomr&#xe5;dena i genomf&#xf6;randet av kommissionens arbete Global Gateway.Sekunderingen &#xe4;r en m&#xe5;ngsidig policyroll i en enhet som spelar en nyckelroll i att fr&#xe4;mja Team Europe-strategin, st&#xf6;dja utrullningen av Global Gateway och dess 360-gradersstrategi samt fr&#xe4;mja utvecklingseffekt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution concerns the secondment of a national expert as Effective Development Policy Officer for Team Europe to EU-Commission DG INTPA. Unit INTPA.D.1 is the hub of the Team Europe strategy and coordinates the different work areas in the implementation of the Commission&apos;s work Global Gateway. The secondment is a multi-faceted policy role in a unit that plays a key role in promoting the Team Europe strategy, supporting the roll-out of the Global Gateway and its 360-degree strategy, and promoting development impact.</narrative>
  </description>
